{"repositoryId":326987208,"availability":"available","full":"citizensadvice/page-fragmentor","name":"page-fragmentor","description":"Spilt a HTML page into printable pages","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":3,"created":"2021-01-05T12:08:33Z","updated":"2026-10-16T13:46:50Z","license":"ISC","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["case-management"],"demo":"https://citizensadvice.github.io/page-fragmentor/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.269Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.269Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.269Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.269Z","stars":0,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This will split a page into multiple printable pages with custom headers and footers. It is intended to be used to create PDFs from HTML with solutions such Gotenberg or Puppeteer / Playwright.","The page breaks can be previewed in the browser, but each browser will render the page slightly differently. This means the page breaks cannot be guaranteed to be in the same place in each browser. Hyphenation, bold, italic, font-sizes, font-family and sub and sup text may result in subtle differences.","This is inspired by paged.js. That library is a full polyfill for CSS paged media. This library is a simpler sub-set of features, but allowing greater customisation of headers and footers."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/citizensadvice/page-fragmentor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1d47a91a95c3f9cea3cc72b3843619360fbf63eac5c1fb3d15d6254b01babe5b","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.397Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:12:55.397Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This will split a page into multiple printable pages with custom headers and footers. It is intended to be used to create PDFs from HTML with solutions such Gotenberg or Puppeteer / Playwright.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/citizensadvice/page-fragm